    {
      "id": "42370fd9-1edd-816d-b772-cd6a44419c20",
      "title": "Unframe Festival 2026",
      "slug": "ceangailte-unframe-2026",
      "description": "Ceangailte at Unframe Festival in Berlin, shown at the same time as at Nano Nagle Place for Culture Night in Cork, with a live connection between the two venues.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>Ceangailte was shown at the same time in Berlin and Cork: here at Unframe Festival, and at Nano Nagle Place for Culture Night. A live connection between the two venues was a small, symbolic gesture towards the connections the work is about.</p><p>Showing it in both cities connects where the two of us came from with where the idea for Ceangailte was first conceived. Both Culture Night in Cork and Unframe Festival in Berlin share values of solidarity and a desire for change, which the work reflects.</p><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/9cd1e076-sm.jpg\" data-full=\"/images/notion/9cd1e076.jpg\" alt=\"Ceangailte at Unframe Festival, Berlin\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><div class=\"notion-columns\" style=\"--cols:3\"><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/616e0eaa.jpg\" alt=\"Ceangailte at Unframe Festival, Berlin\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/6de2d04e-sm.jpg\" data-full=\"/images/notion/6de2d04e.jpg\" alt=\"Ceangailte at Unframe Festival, Berlin\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/a8251f43-sm.jpg\" data-full=\"/images/notion/a8251f43.jpg\" alt=\"Ceangailte at Unframe Festival, Berlin\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div></div><div class=\"notion-columns\" style=\"--cols:2\"><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/3b9ce3d9.jpg\" alt=\"Ceangailte at Unframe Festival, Berlin\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/e13789bc.jpg\" alt=\"Ceangailte at Unframe Festival, Berlin\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div></div>",
