    {
      "id": "3ec70fd9-1edd-804f-856f-ead1832e32b0",
      "title": "Berlin New Media Art Week 2026",
      "slug": "read-rites-bnmw-2026",
      "description": "“read:rites | cannibalize” is an audio-visual critique of cultural recycling and the myth of progress, framed as a terminal command to dissect and devour the familiar. The performance interrogates how our media and culture, particularly music, are endlessly reworked, while true creativity is sacrificed to algorithmic hunger and corporate control.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>The third and most recent performance of read:rites | cannibalize, after XoK Blackout (December 2025) and B.L.O. Ateliers × co:evolve (February 2026).</p><p>A machine instructs a silent human operator to feed it the last century of recorded music, so that it can understand us. It devours the music decade by decade. With each pass the material is sampled and resampled faster, the loops get shorter, and the fragments come back more eroded.</p><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/42be0c32-sm.jpg\" data-full=\"/images/notion/42be0c32.jpg\" alt=\"read:rites | cannibalize at The Space, Berlin New Media Week 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><div class=\"notion-columns\" style=\"--cols:3\"><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/a22ecc0b.jpg\" alt=\"read:rites | cannibalize at The Space, Berlin New Media Week 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/2d75715d.jpg\" alt=\"read:rites | cannibalize at The Space, Berlin New Media Week 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/2ac3b88e.jpg\" alt=\"read:rites | cannibalize at The Space, Berlin New Media Week 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div></div><div class=\"notion-columns\" style=\"--cols:3\"><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/f41b0c45-sm.jpg\" data-full=\"/images/notion/f41b0c45.jpg\" alt=\"read:rites | cannibalize at The Space, Berlin New Media Week 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/4ba2641a-sm.jpg\" data-full=\"/images/notion/4ba2641a.jpg\" alt=\"read:rites | cannibalize at The Space, Berlin New Media Week 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></div><div class=\"notion-column\"><figure><img src=\"/images/notion/50bcb0fe-sm.jpg\" data-full=\"/images/notion/50bcb0fe.jpg\" alt=\"read:rites | cannibalize at The Space, Berlin New Media Week 2026\" loading=\"lazy\"