    {
      "id": "3ec70fd9-1edd-80a6-9729-d7335c9c1a87",
      "title": "Xposed Queer Film Festival",
      "slug": "panel-xposed-2026",
      "description": "Panelist in discussion, with topics about: Building and remixing, New media tools and technologies, The role of the body in our works, constructing and imagining spaces and whether it is possible to have an anti capitalist approach as a new media artist.",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>A panel on how expanded and experimental forms of storytelling open up new artistic possibilities. We talked about building and remixing, new media tools and technologies, the role of the body in our works, constructing and imagining spaces, and whether it is possible to have an anti-capitalist approach as a new media artist.</p><p>It was a pleasure to be among all the different panelists and to learn about the different approaches we all have. It was also my first time doing any sort of public speaking in an artistic form. I'm much more comfortable when I have instruments or machines at hand to manipulate, so it was a great challenge. I'm looking forward to doing it again.</p>",
