    {
      "id": "35c70fd9-1edd-80bd-ad48-d413a9c07620",
      "title": "Berlin New Media Art Week 2025",
      "slug": "fractured-recall-bnmw-2025",
      "description": "",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>A live audio/visual set built from the ground up around the fallibility of memory. Found footage and point-cloud recreations of real spaces stretched an existing live set into a performance that could be mistaken for the viewer's own fractured memories.</p><p>Performed as part of Intelligent Kin, an exhibition of digital works on new forms of intelligence, perception and relation at MaHalla, with audiovisual performances on select days.</p><figure class=\"video-embed video-embed--direct\" data-video-player>\n        <div class=\"video-embed__player-wrapper\">\n          <video class=\"video-embed__player\" playsinline >\n            <source src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/u00li3hi2qy83hkdc5wmu/bnmaw-mahalla-teaser-web.mp4?rlkey=qltoxy5dtusqdyuqjuqxg4lc6&raw=1\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n          </video>\n          <div class=\"video-embed__overlay\">\n            <button class=\"video-embed__play-btn\" aria-label=\"Play video\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"currentColor\"><polygon points=\"5,3 19,12 5,21\"/></svg>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"video-embed__controls\">\n            <div class=\"video-embed__controls-track-wrap\">\n              <div class=\"video-embed__controls-track\"><div class=\"video-embed__controls-fill\"></div></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"video-embed__controls-row\">\n              <button class=\"video-embed__ctrl-btn video-embed__ctrl-play\" aria-label=\"Play\">\n                <svg class=\"video-embed__ctrl-icon video-embed__ctrl-icon--play\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><polygon points=\"5,3 19,12 5,21\"/></svg>\n                <svg class=\"video-embed__ctrl-icon video-embed__ctrl-icon--pause\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"display:none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\"